      "\"Are you burning the chicken?\" asked Yui. \"There's smoke coming from the kitchen.\"",
      "\"Oh no!\" said Daichi. He raced back into the kitchen.",
      "Takumi laughed.",
      "\"You too, Ta-kun,\" said Yui.",
      "\"Me?\" Takumi pointed at his chest.",
      "\"You ruined miso soup,\" said Yui. \"I think you both should take cooking lessons.\"",
