      "The next Saturday, Daichi and Takumi stood at their table in the community center classroom.",
      "\"Are you sure about this?\" asked Takumi. He looked around at the other students. There were two retired men, a university student with heavy black makeup and three young housewives.",
      "\"Yui recommended this place,\" said Daichi. \"She's the one with the most cooking experience.\"",
      "\"Okay, but the teacher is a little scary,\" said Takumi.",
      "\"Now, class. I want you to crack three eggs into the bowl and whip them with your whisk,\" said Mrs. Kurogane. She crossed her arms and stared at them.",
