      "***SCENE_BREAK***",
      "\"Okay, let's check what you made,\" said Mrs. Kurogane. She went to one of the retired businessmen and tried a bite of his omelet rice. \"Not bad, Mr. Suzuki. Next time, use a bit more salt.\"",
      "\"Thank you, Sensei,\" said Mr. Suzuki.",
