      "\"Are you sure about this?\" asked Kaoru. She and Yui sat in the corner of the class. Several other people were sitting in chairs next to them.",
      "\"I've tried your curry before, Dai-chan,\" said Yui. \"It was closer to soup than curry.\"",
      "\"Don't worry,\" said Daichi. \"You'll love it.\"",
      "Takumi leaned forward. \"He's been practicing all week for this,\" he said. He followed Daichi to the table and opened the recipe book.",
