      "***SCENE_BREAK***",
      "Yui looked at the plate of curry rice and sniffed. \"It smells okay,\" she said. What did you put in it?\"",
      "\"I wanted to add more flavour, so I put in some coffee,\" said Takumi. \"My mom used to use that back home.\"",
